% Fixture for tests/test_bibtex.py.
%
% Deliberately irregular formatting: real .bib files exported by different
% tools (EndNote, Zotero, hand-maintained files edited over a decade) never
% agree on one entry per line, and a parser that only works on the tidy case
% is not exercised by anything real. Do not "clean up" the two entries on
% line 12, the duplicate citekey, or the unterminated block below — each one
% is the point of a specific test.
